            <div>
              <h4>EEG / Brain Mapping</h4>
              <p>Electroencephalogram recording to assess brain activity for seizures and neurological disorders. Duration: 60–90 min.</p>
              <span class="service-price">$320</span>
            </div>
            <a href="appointment.html" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Book This</a>
          </div>
