    <!-- Featured Treatment Detail -->
    <section class="section bg-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header" data-aos="fade-up">
          <span class="eyebrow">Featured Procedure</span>
          <h2>Knee Arthroscopy — What to Expect</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="treatment-detail">
          <div class="treatment-content">
            <img class="treatment-hero" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579684385127-1ef15d508118?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Orthopedic surgery team performing arthroscopy" />
            <div class="treatment-body">
              <p>Knee arthroscopy is a minimally invasive procedure that allows our orthopedic surgeons to diagnose and treat problems inside the knee joint using a small camera and specialized instruments — resulting in smaller incisions and faster recovery than open surgery.</p>
              <h3>What It Treats</h3>
              <ul class="treatment-features">
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Torn meniscus repair or removal</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> ACL/PCL ligament reconstruction</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Removal of loose cartilage fragments</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Diagnosis of unexplained knee pain or swelling</li>
              </ul>
              <h3>Recovery Timeline</h3>
              <p>Most patients walk with support within 24 hours and resume light activity in 1–2 weeks. Full recovery with physiotherapy typically takes 4–8 weeks depending on the procedure performed.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="treatment-sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-card">
              <div class="treatment-price-tag">$2,800</div>
              <ul class="treatment-meta-list">
                <li><span>Department</span><span>Orthopedics</span></li>
                <li><span>Duration</span><span>1–2 hours</span></li>
                <li><span>Anesthesia</span><span>Regional / General</span></li>
                <li><span>Hospital Stay</span><span>Same-day or 1 night</span></li>
              </ul>
              <a href="appointment.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-block mt-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Book This Treatment</a>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
